::MCQ::
In which namespace are variables typically defined inside a function?
{
~ Global Namespace
~ Built-In Namespace
~ Enclosing Namespace
= Local Namespace
}

::MCQ::
What occurs when a function is defined inside another function?
{
~ Global Namespace is created
= Enclosing Namespace is created
~ Local Namespace is eliminated
~ Built-In Namespace is modified
}

::MCQ::
Which namespace allows variables to be imported into other modules?
{
~ Local Namespace
~ Enclosing Namespace
= Global Namespace
~ Built-In Namespace
}

::MCQ::
Variables in the Built-In Namespace can be modified by the user.
{
~ True
= False
}

::MCQ::
An inner function can access variables from its outer function's namespace.
{
= True
~ False
}
